cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Ecoa Saúde"
version: "1.0.1"
abstract: >-
  Open-source, evidence-grounded assistant for checking health
  misinformation in Brazilian Portuguese. A language model extracts the
  verifiable claim, the server retrieves professional fact-checks and recent
  news, and a second model call returns a verdict with dated, cited reasons.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/yagodejesus/ecoa-saude"
url: "https://ecoa-saude-app.up.railway.app"
keywords:
  - health misinformation
  - automated fact-checking
  - large language models
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - infodemic management
  - Brazilian Portuguese
